					"content": "我得先看看這些史萊姆凝液的品質如何…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230135205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230135205,
					"content": "這是您的報酬，再次感謝您的幫助，旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230135206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230135206,
					"content": "您之後有空的話，也請多多過來看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230135207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
